### Health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health

### Chat request - DTC lookup
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "What does DTC code P10301 mean?"
}

### Chat request - PDF related question
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "What are the troubleshooting steps for the related fault DTC code P10301?"
}

### Chat request - general support lookup
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "Explain the issue in the support documents and suggest the repair action."
}

### Chat request - vague question should trigger clarification
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "my vehicle is not working"
}

### Chat request - vague but still specific enough for normal answer
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "DTC P10301 in a 2022 FF truck"
}
